**
** ============================================================================
** Temperatura de referencia (estado livre de deformacao) = 0 em todos os nos
** ============================================================================
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
NALL, 0.0
**
** ============================================================================
** AMPLITUDE -- rampa linear (Dz + inchaco crescem juntos no pseudo-tempo)
** ============================================================================
*AMPLITUDE, NAME=DZRAMP
0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 1.0
**
*STEP, NLGEOM=YES, INC=500
*STATIC, RIKS
0.025, 1.0, 1e-5, 0.05, 2.5
**
** ====================================================================
** INCHACO DO SAS (PIC) -- "temperatura" imposta nos nos do SAS
** ====================================================================
** T_pico = 0.10 -> deformacao livre linear 10% (vol ~30%) no SAS confinado.
** Rampada via DZRAMP. Tune este valor para regular a pressao/hoop tension.
*TEMPERATURE, AMPLITUDE=DZRAMP
SAS_NODES, 0.10
**
** ====================================================================
** Engastes
** ====================================================================
*BOUNDARY
POSTERIOR_ON,   1, 3, 0.0
POSTERIOR_PIA,  1, 3, 0.0
POSTERIOR_SAS,  1, 3, 0.0
POSTERIOR_DURA, 1, 3, 0.0
**
*BOUNDARY
ANTERIOR_GLOBO, 1, 2, 0.0
**
*BOUNDARY, AMPLITUDE=DZRAMP
ANTERIOR_GLOBO, 3, 3, -1.50e-3
**
** EOM (musculos extraoculares) -- "a do globo"
*CLOAD, AMPLITUDE=DZRAMP
ANTERIOR_GLOBO, 3, -1.0e-4
**
** Sem perturbacao lateral A/B (variante sP).
**
** Outputs por incremento (.dat)
*NODE PRINT, FREQUENCY=1, NSET=POSTERIOR_DURA, TOTALS=ONLY
RF, U
*NODE PRINT, FREQUENCY=1, NSET=POSTERIOR_PIA, TOTALS=ONLY
RF, U
*NODE PRINT, FREQUENCY=1, NSET=POSTERIOR_ON, TOTALS=ONLY
RF, U
*NODE PRINT, FREQUENCY=1, NSET=ANTERIOR_GLOBO, TOTALS=ONLY
RF, U
**
*NODE FILE, FREQUENCY=5
U, RF, NT
*EL FILE, FREQUENCY=5
S, E
**
*END STEP
